+either way (mismatch is reported, not treated as test failure) — see
+`test_batch.cpp` for the exact logic.
+
+Not done in this tick: the CUDA leg for int8 (would mirror `cuda-tree`/
+the still-outstanding `cuda-batch-grouped`), and steps 5-6 (wiring all 6
+batch×{fp32,int8} configs into `plan.py`'s digest table and an actual
